textfont=graphic_20452
fontmono=no
text=Players may opt into PvP combat around the convoys and building sites.<br><br>You  will not lose items if you are killed in an event PvP area.<br><br>Players with PvP enabled will earn twice as much renown and 33% more experience for each action.
