[com_41]
type=text
x=4
y=4
width=8
height=8
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
ymode=abs_bottom
layer=com_40
textfont=graphic_20452
fontmono=no
text=The vast and mighty Bandos tried to conquer the world during the Fifth Age using a proxy Commander, but was thwarted by an adventurer’s interference.<br><br>With Guthix’s protection lifted from Gielinor, Bandos has returned in person and this time intends to finish the job, starting with his ancient avian foe. 
textshadow=yes

[com_42]
type=text
x=4
y=4
width=8
height=8
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
ymode=abs_bottom
layer=com_39
textfont=graphic_20452
fontmono=no
text=The avian god of freedom and justice, Armadyl once departed Gielinor in rage and grief thinking that a betrayal in the God Wars had wiped out his followers.<br><br>Since discovering a band of survivors, Armadyl has returned in a fiery blaze determined to do what is right, and equally determined to not be used again. 
textshadow=yes

